sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Member
  participant UI as Coach UI
  participant API as AI Route / SSE
  participant Guard as Policy + Context Resolver
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Cache as Redis
  participant Model as Groq / Gemini Router
  participant Eval as Safety / Quality Evaluator

  U->>UI: Ask coach with selected scopes
  UI->>API: POST /api/v1/ai/runs + contextGrantIds
  API->>Guard: Authenticate, authorize, check consent and budget
  Guard->>DB: Load only granted source records and versions
  Guard->>Guard: Minimize, redact, label provenance, resist injection
  Guard->>Cache: Check safe semantic/result cache by tenant + policy version
  API->>DB: Persist AI run, prompt/model/policy versions, source manifest
  API->>Model: Resolve alias and select eligible Groq/Gemini under privacy and budget policy
  API->>Model: Stream provider-neutral request
  Model-->>API: Token / structured output stream
  API-->>UI: SSE events: delta, citation, usage, status
  API->>Eval: Validate schema, grounding, safety, action boundaries
  Eval-->>API: pass / repair / fallback
  API->>DB: Store final output, evidence links, cost, evaluation
  API-->>UI: completed event

  alt Output proposes a write
    API->>DB: Save expiring AIProposal only
    UI-->>U: Show diff, rationale, sources, consequences
    U->>API: POST /ai/proposals/{id}/accept + Idempotency-Key
    API->>Guard: Reauthorize and revalidate current versions
    Guard->>DB: Execute domain command transactionally
    API-->>U: Confirmed domain result
  else Provider, quota, or policy failure
    API-->>UI: Safe error + deterministic non-AI path
  end
